Package: viyar
Title: SAS Viya Compute and CAS Integration for R via REST
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Samiul", "Haque", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "samiul.haque@posit.co"),
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Connect R to SAS Viya using only REST APIs. Provides compute
    session management, SAS code submission, libref and dataset discovery,
    bidirectional data transfer, Viya Files/Folders access, caslib
    table loading with promotion, and read and write access to the SAS
    Clinical Acceleration Repository. Complements 'swat' (CAS-only) and offers
    a pure-R alternative to Python-based 'saspy'/'sasr' with no Python
    dependency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    curl,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    utils,
    stats
Suggests:
    rstudioapi,
    connectapi,
    knitr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    pkgload,
    withr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
